@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Safehome Security Function

[*] --> PowerOnCheck

state "Power-On Check" as PowerOnCheck
state "Ready to Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "Off" as Off

PowerOnCheck --> ReadyToUse : Everything is fine
PowerOnCheck --> [*] : Problem during startup

ReadyToUse --> Reset : User resets the system
ReadyToUse --> Activate : User activates the system
ReadyToUse --> TurnOff : User turns off the system
ReadyToUse --> Monitoring : System becomes ready to use and starts monitoring

Monitoring --> AlarmActivated : Sensor is triggered
Monitoring --> ContinueMonitoring : False alarm or time ends

AlarmActivated --> ReadyToUse : Stop alarm and return to normal

TurnOff --> Off : System stops and returns to off state

@enduml
